settings-cookiesToPreserve-title = Cookies to preserve
settings-cookiesToPreserve-description = Everything else in a browser's cookie file is gone the moment you clean it. Scan to see what's actually there, and tick anything worth keeping.
settings-cookiesToPreserve-scanButton = Scan for cookies
settings-cookiesToPreserve-scanning = Scanning…
