startup-title = Startup
startup-subtitle = What runs when you sign in: the Run keys and Startup folders Windows reads, grouped by where they live — which is what decides who an entry affects and what it takes to remove it. An entry whose file is gone was left behind by a program that was removed carelessly, and Windows keeps trying to launch it every time.
